      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1i7",
          "text": "In Colorado, catastrophic injury is generally understood as an injury causing lasting disability, mobility limits, or inability to work.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1ia",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1i9",
          "text": "Personal injury usually involves temporary harm with expected recovery and limited long-term impact.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1ic",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ib",
          "text": "Catastrophic claims require expert testimony and projections of long-term costs and care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1ie",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1id",
          "text": "Damages include future medical care, lost earning capacity, and non-economic losses like pain.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1il",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1ig",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/long-term-effects-of-car-accidents/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1if",
          "text": "Injuries are not all treated the same under the law, and the difference in classification can mean everything for a claim. A broken wrist and a traumatic brain injury may both result from the same ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ih",
          "text": "car accident",
          "marks": [
            "l1ig"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ii",
          "text": ", but they follow completely different legal paths. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ij",
          "text": "Catastrophic personal injury",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ik",
          "text": " cases involve losses that extend far beyond medical bills, often reshaping every aspect of a person’s life for years to come.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1is",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1in",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1im",
          "text": "Understanding where a claim falls on the spectrum determines the compensation available, the experts needed, and the legal strategy required to pursue full recovery. For families navigating this reality in Denver, the experienced ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1io",
          "text": "personal injury attorneys",
          "marks": [
            "l1in"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ip",
          "text": " at ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1iq",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ir",
          "text": " bring the legal depth, resources, and personal commitment to build the strongest possible case at every stage of litigation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1iu",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1it",
          "text": "Catastrophic Injury Cases",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1iw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1iv",
          "text": "The legal distinction between a catastrophic injury and a general personal injury claim comes down to one core question: how permanently has the injury changed the person’s life? Most personal injuries are serious but temporary, meaning recovery is realistic and the long-term financial impact is measurable and contained. Catastrophic injuries follow a different path; they create permanent, life-altering conditions that affect a person’s physical or cognitive abilities, their independence, and their capacity to earn a living, often for the rest of their life.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1iy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ix",
          "text": "In Colorado, the term “catastrophic” does not come from a single statute. Courts, insurers, and attorneys look at whether an injury limits mobility, prevents a return to work, or creates a lasting disability. When those factors are present, the claim requires a more advanced legal strategy, more extensive expert testimony, and a thorough accounting of long-term losses that a standard personal injury case simply does not demand.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1j0",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1iz",
          "text": "Examples of Catastrophic Injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1j2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1j1",
          "text": "Catastrophic injuries typically involve severe trauma to critical body systems. Common examples include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1j5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1j3",
