        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1j4",
          "text": "Traumatic brain injuries",
          "marks": [
            "l1j3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1j7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1j6",
          "text": "Spinal cord injuries resulting in paralysis",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1j9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1j8",
          "text": "Severe burns requiring extensive treatment",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ja",
          "text": "Amputations or loss of limb function",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jc",
          "text": "Permanent vision or hearing loss",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1je",
          "text": "What these injuries share is permanence, and permanence is precisely what drives the legal and financial complexity of every case that follows.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i1jg",
      "src": "./images/2026-05-catastrophic-personal-injury.jpg",
      "alt": "catastrophic personal injury"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1ji",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jh",
          "text": "Personal Injury Cases",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1jk",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/5-things-you-can-do-to-protect-your-personal-injury-case/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jj",
          "text": "The law distinguishes between injuries that heal and those that do not. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jl",
          "text": "personal injury case",
          "marks": [
            "l1jk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jm",
          "text": " covers a broad range of harm caused by another party’s negligence, most of which improves over time with proper medical care. Common examples include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jo",
          "text": "Whiplash or soft tissue injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jq",
          "text": "Broken bones with expected recovery",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1js",
          "text": "Minor concussions",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ju",
          "text": "Sprains and strains",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jw",
          "text": "These injuries warrant real compensation, but the legal complexity stays within a different range. A standard personal injury claim in Denver centers on medical costs, lost income, and recovery expenses. Disputes over liability are still common, and the outcome depends heavily on how well the case is built.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1jz",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1jy",
          "text": "The Main Differences Between Catastrophic Injury and Personal Injury Cases",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1k1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1k0",
          "text": "The distinction between these case types goes beyond medical severity. Several legal and financial factors set them apart:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1k3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1k2",
          "text": "Duration of impact covers lifelong challenges, while personal injuries typically resolve within a defined recovery period",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1k5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1k4",
          "text": "Medical needs often include ongoing care, rehabilitation, or assistive support",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1k7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1k6",
          "text": "Earning capacity can be permanently eliminated, rather than temporarily reduced",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1k9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1k8",
          "text": "Case complexity requires expert testimony from medical specialists and economic professionals",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ka",
          "text": "Settlement value increases significantly when long-term damages are present",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kc",
          "text": "These differences shape the entire legal approach. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kd",
          "text": "catastrophic personal injury",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ke",
          "text": " claim demands future cost projections, specialized expert testimony, and a strategy built around losses that can span decades, while a standard personal injury case centers on current expenses and short-term recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kh",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kg",
          "text": "Damages You Might Recover After A Catastrophic Injury",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ki",
          "text": "The broader the injury’s impact on a person’s life, the broader the range of compensation available. Catastrophic injury claims typically involve both economic and non-economic losses, and building a complete picture of both is essential to recovering full value.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kk",
          "text": "Economic damages may cover:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1km",
          "text": "Medical expenses, including future care",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ko",
          "text": "Rehabilitation and therapy costs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kq",
          "text": "Lost income and reduced earning capacity",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1kt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ks",
          "text": "Home modifications or assistive equipment",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1ky",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1kv",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/sites/default/files/2024-06/Chapter%206_1.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ku",
          "text": "Non-economic damages reflect the personal toll of the injury. Under the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kw",
          "text": "Colorado Jury Instructions",
          "marks": [
            "l1kv"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kx",
          "text": " on damages, these losses may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1l2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l1l0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/how-is-pain-and-suffering-calculated/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1kz",
          "text": "Physical ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1l1",
          "text": "pain and suffering",
          "marks": [
            "l1l0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1l4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1l3",
          "text": "Emotional distress",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1l6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1l5",
          "text": "Inconvenience",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1l8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1l7",
          "text": "Reduced quality of life",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1la",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1l9",
          "text": "In cases where the defendant’s conduct was particularly reckless or willful, Colorado law may allow punitive damages on top of compensatory losses. Carefully documenting both current and future needs is equally essential, as what a person requires today can look very different years down the road.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1lc",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1lb",
          "text": "How Are Catastrophic Injury Settlements Calculated?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1le",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ld",
          "text": "Unlike standard claims, catastrophic injury settlements depend heavily on projections rather than current losses. Economic experts factor in life expectancy, inflation, and anticipated care needs to assign a present value to future costs, while medical professionals provide opinions on long-term outcomes that directly shape those numbers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1lg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1lf",
          "text": "In Denver, building a credible damages figure typically requires coordinating multiple specialists across medical and financial disciplines, because insurers will scrutinize every projection and investigate how to reduce what they ultimately pay. Having experienced legal counsel from the start can make a significant difference in how those projections hold up, and in whether the full extent of a person’s future losses is ever properly presented to begin with.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1li",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1lh",
          "text": "What’s the Average Settlement for a Catastrophic Injury?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1lk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1lj",
          "text": "There is no true average, because every case turns on its own long-term factors. Settlement values vary based on injury severity, required care, and impact on earning capacity. A spinal cord injury resulting in paralysis, for example, typically leads to far higher compensation than a less disabling condition due to lifelong medical needs and lost income.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1lm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1ll",
          "text": "Colorado’s modified comparative negligence rule can also affect the final figure, reducing compensation based on a person’s share of fault. Rather than focusing on averages, experienced legal counsel works to develop the full scope of damages, both immediate and long-term, so nothing of value is left on the table.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
